  "title": "Ninety-Minute Cinnamon Rolls",
  "description": "These homemade cinnamon rolls are made in just 90 minutes with a quick-rising dough that&#39;s simple to make for the perfect kid-friendly sweet treat.",
  "authors": [
    "GOOFYDEBBIE"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-03-15T20:22:20-05:00",
